sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Folio
    participant API as ConversationSessionController
    participant Conversation as ConversationService
    participant Scope as ConversationScopeService
    participant MySQL
    participant Redis
    participant Chat as ChatHandler

    User->>Folio: create conversation
    Folio->>API: POST /users/conversations
    API->>Conversation: createConversationSession(userId)
    Conversation->>MySQL: save ACTIVE session + default AUTO_LIBRARY scope
    Conversation->>Redis: set current conversation with 7-day TTL
    Conversation-->>Folio: conversationId + scope summary
    User->>Folio: select papers / collections / title match
    Folio->>API: PUT /{conversationId}/scope
    API->>Scope: updateUnlockedScope
    Scope->>MySQL: lock owned session row
    Scope->>Scope: authorize and require searchable papers
    Scope->>MySQL: save source recipe + immutable paper-ID snapshot
    Scope-->>Folio: READY unlocked scope
    User->>Folio: send first question
    Folio->>Chat: WebSocket chat command
    Chat->>Scope: lockForFirstMessage
    Scope->>MySQL: validate snapshot and set scopeLocked=true
    Scope-->>Chat: authorized paper IDs for Harness
    Note over Scope,Chat: Later scope updates return 409<br/>each turn remains inside the first-message snapshot
    alt switch session
        Folio->>API: PUT /{conversationId}/switch
        API->>Conversation: verify ownership
        Conversation->>Redis: replace current conversation with 7-day TTL
    else archive / unarchive
        Folio->>API: PUT archive or unarchive
        API->>MySQL: verify ownership + update session status
    else delete
        Folio->>API: DELETE /{conversationId}
        API->>MySQL: delete owned messages + session
        API->>Redis: clear current pointer when it matched
    end
